stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> reserved: Partner reserves selected files
  reserved --> receiving: Partner sends bytes
  receiving --> staged: Verified bytes stored and receipt committed
  receiving --> rejected: Byte count, hash or format differs
  receiving --> retryable_unknown: Storage or receipt result uncertain
  retryable_unknown --> staged: Readback verifies object
  reserved --> cancelled: Partner cancels
  staged --> cancelled: Temporary object deleted
  rejected --> cancelled: Partner cancels
  reserved --> expired: One day passes
  staged --> expired: One day passes
  retryable_unknown --> expired: One day passes
  receiving --> expired: One day passes
  rejected --> expired: One day passes
  %% never Report filed from byte staging
  %% never Accept bytes for another actor, session, tenant or deal
  %% never Refund quota while an uncertain object can still exist
